{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "sha256:b06e3affbc3eaea9d570071231f39f4f602f7894d75495c7075b12a5e3166341", "hash": "sha256:b06e3affbc3eaea9d570071231f39f4f602f7894d75495c7075b12a5e3166341", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 398689, "byte_start": 397343, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:cb7f874112f293be6be9dea50e431f9bcb21333db4cab1d84048938a3b8986e7", "line_end": 10882, "line_start": 10856}, "owner_tag": "087S", "parent_tag": "01W7", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{E}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathbf{P}(\\mathcal{E}) \\to S$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{E}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_S^{\\oplus n} \\to \\mathcal{E}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\mathbf{P}(\\mathcal{E}) \\longrightarrow\n\\mathbf{P}(\\mathcal{O}_S^{\\oplus n}) = \\mathbf{P}^{n - 1}_S\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0010": "$S$", "MATH_0011": "$n$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{E} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_S} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes n}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathbf{P}(\\mathcal{E}) =\n\\mathbf{P}(\\mathcal{E} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_S} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes n})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-definition-ample}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{properties-lemma-ample-immersion-into-proj}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-proj-separated}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-projective-open-projective}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{properties-proposition-characterize-ample}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-twisting-and-proj}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e10e3c9a2b9d99260f654397810c14a8fb3d04359d5d30044b21b89075da8754", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:43892e3c3bcb5465d8e7d36a1e998ab49141fc816bc6a101dab7fe9548619080", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nThe assumptions on <MATH_0001> imply that <MATH_0002> is quasi-compact and separated, see\nProperties, Definition <REF_0001> and\nLemma <REF_0002>\nand Constructions, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nHence Lemma <REF_0004>\napplies and we see that (1) implies (2).\nLet <MATH_0003> be a finite type quasi-coherent <MATH_0004>-module.\nBy our definition of projective morphisms it suffices to show that\n<MATH_0005> is H-projective.\nIf <MATH_0006> is generated by finitely many global sections,\nthen the corresponding surjection <MATH_0007>\ninduces a closed immersion\n<MATH_0008>\nas desired. In general, let <MATH_0009> be an ample invertible sheaf on <MATH_0010>.\nBy Properties, Proposition <REF_0005>\nthere exists an integer <MATH_0011> such that\n<MATH_0012>\nis globally generated by finitely many sections. Since\n<MATH_0013> by\nConstructions, Lemma <REF_0006>\nthis finishes the proof.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4af802f2ce1926fe1762311fe70f81ec7f508816f1a50235b3a571513911532d", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:087S:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:0f4ab1dcc9a267d46c9e13e8ed5021e8499939cbce7901df15a49e8b4e5c36c0", "hash": "sha256:0f4ab1dcc9a267d46c9e13e8ed5021e8499939cbce7901df15a49e8b4e5c36c0", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 399941, "byte_start": 399098, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:ccda0ee34f12ea193d883cf15cb8ff51d64d1c89319b476e938c4b76be6eaf86", "line_end": 10917, "line_start": 10900}, "owner_tag": "0C6J", "parent_tag": "01W7", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$r$", "MATH_0005": "$r$", "MATH_0006": "$r$", "MATH_0007": "$S$", "MATH_0008": "$r$", "MATH_0009": "$r$", "MATH_0010": "$S$", "MATH_0011": "$r$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-image-proper-scheme-closed}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-relative-proj-separated}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{properties-lemma-ample-immersion-into-proj}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-relatively-ample}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{properties-lemma-map-into-proj}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:90cc1dfc2db7e7cd68dc19797fae376e7b417e8f6cf8440ed5e01c3d232fe650", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f920123abcd3c8894613e7aa72393dbb312366d261625b45387b11334e3e32eb", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nObserve that <MATH_0001> is quasi-compact because the existence\nof an <MATH_0002>-ample invertible module forces <MATH_0003> to be quasi-compact.\nBy the lemma cited the morphism <MATH_0004> is an open immersion.\nOn the other hand, the image of <MATH_0005> is closed by\nLemma <REF_0001>\n(the target of <MATH_0006> is separated over <MATH_0007> by Constructions,\nLemma <REF_0002>).\nFinally, the image of <MATH_0008> is dense by\nProperties, Lemma <REF_0003>\n(here we also use that it was shown in the proof of\nLemma <REF_0004>\nthat the morphism <MATH_0009> over affine opens of <MATH_0010>\nis given by the canonical morphism of\nProperties, Lemma <REF_0005>).\nThus we conclude that <MATH_0011> is a surjective open immersion, i.e.,\nan isomorphism.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0506687dc69528f75b8112434f60203ec877e230bfc7216f387c186dd869c154", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:0C6J:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:8918cdfd1441aa89657b38fc2f28ceb0e74c474d6d2f7f10ee1b64856a54c5ab", "hash": "sha256:8918cdfd1441aa89657b38fc2f28ceb0e74c474d6d2f7f10ee1b64856a54c5ab", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 314196, "byte_start": 312886, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:24bebb71803415f1e24df62d44fb58a7aee1b43f00948267a0fa031b97155dda", "line_end": 8713, "line_start": 8679}, "owner_tag": "01VJ", "parent_tag": "01VG", "requested_label": "morphisms-lemma-characterize-relatively-ample", "requested_tag": "01VJ", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-characterize-relatively-ample}", "LOCKED_0002": "\\begin{reference}\n\\cite[II, Proposition 4.6.3]{EGA}\n\\end{reference}", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$S = \\bigcup V_i$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{L}|_{f^{-1}(V_i)}$", "MATH_0008": "$f^{-1}(V_i) \\to V_i$", "MATH_0009": "$S = \\bigcup V_i$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{L}|_{f^{-1}(V_i)}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0014": "$\\psi : f^*\\mathcal{A} \\to \\bigoplus_{d \\geq 0} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d}$", "MATH_0015": "$U(\\psi) = X$", "MATH_0016": "$$\nr_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi} :\nX\n\\longrightarrow\n\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})\n$$", "MATH_0017": "$f$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{A} = f_*(\\bigoplus_{d \\geq 0} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d})$", "MATH_0019": "$\\psi$", "MATH_0020": "$r_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-invertible-map-into-relative-proj}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\item", "STRUCT_0008": "\\item", "STRUCT_0009": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0010": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d75ab0df8a8cf3f009bc41393b6b8718a672c6a7a47642240a032680586dfaf4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:796925ed5741ea571f8e5a58fc053d5dd753848021ccd7666d86a65555673850", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\n<LOCKED_0002>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an invertible sheaf on <MATH_0003>.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> The invertible sheaf <MATH_0004> is <MATH_0005>-ample.\n<STRUCT_0004> There exists an open covering <MATH_0006>\nsuch that each <MATH_0007> is ample\nrelative to <MATH_0008>.\n<STRUCT_0005> There exists an affine open covering <MATH_0009>\nsuch that each <MATH_0010> is ample.\n<STRUCT_0006> There exists a quasi-coherent graded <MATH_0011>-algebra\n<MATH_0012> and a map of graded <MATH_0013>-algebras\n<MATH_0014>\nsuch that <MATH_0015> and\n<MATH_0016>\nis an open immersion (see Constructions, Lemma\n<REF_0001> for notation).\n<STRUCT_0007> The morphism <MATH_0017> is quasi-separated and\npart (4) above holds with\n<MATH_0018>\nand <MATH_0019> the adjunction mapping.\n<STRUCT_0008> Same as (4) but just requiring <MATH_0020>\nto be an immersion.\n<STRUCT_0009>\n<STRUCT_0010>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:07f2505ec1b3a7d2aedc8b54861eb97ec72e5c5ec7ee13d22378da741b9be467", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:01VJ:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:7941ba9efa30fce70e75e276025ba0c657277bebf94c872fb6422ebd4e682493", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p1-29-morphisms-d026.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:c991361791f439dc6fa5d3c248591a59703e235969b8fdfc64aeb361be95deb9", "path": "docs/evidence/p1-29-morphisms-d026-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:a78e25cc1c210d4c0ef97119f9b5a16d0944e46201e4c4dc98698f9632bb7d3d"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:b753f6444727f8fc4aa34d05b8523e6abff18b21", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "